Everything else in Wildpad is under the GNU GPL 3.0 (see ../LICENSE). The firmware
can't be: it contains code by Stefan Wagner (wagiminator, https://github.com/wagiminator)
published under CC BY-SA 3.0 - the CH55x support code in include/ (ch554.h is the
register header by WCH) and the base of the USB control handler in src/usbdev.c.
CC BY-SA requires a work built on it to be shared under the same license, and
version 3.0 can't be relicensed as GPL, so the firmware as a whole stays under
CC BY-SA 3.0. The Xbox 360 interface layout in src/descr.c follows GP2040-CE (MIT).

